application "Media Game" is game

model Player
field name is text
that is all

controller Game
action initialize
set "player left" to 100
set "player top" to 100
that is all

action jump
play sound "assets/jump.wav"
set "player top" to value called "player top" minus 20
that is all

when application starts
run action initialize
show view "world"
that is all

when player presses space
run action jump
that is all

when game updates
set "last frame time" to value called "seconds since last frame"
set "legacy frame time" to seconds_since_last_frame
that is all
that is all

view "world"
fill background with color 18 24 38
draw image "assets/player.bmp" at "player left" "player top" sized 64 by 64
that is all
